	(text "IO J2: 8 data bits + ASTB on pins 1-3, 5-10 (key 4), 100 R + 470 pF on the IO board. IO J3: strobes on 9-12 (12-pin, key 4).\nIO J3 pins 1-8 are AUX_IN inputs of the IO board: left open here. Strobes last 300 ns: GPIO direct, 4.7 k series (5 V tolerant)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
